@page "/"

<PageTitle>GigHaus - Free tools for house concert hosts</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Turn your living room into the best venue in town. GigHaus gives house concert hosts a show page, a guest list and door check-in, free." />
    <meta property="og:title" content="GigHaus - Free tools for house concert hosts" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A show page, a guest list and door check-in for people who open their homes to live music. Free." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="mk-hero">
    <div class="mk-wrap mk-hero__grid">
        <div>
            <p class="mk-kicker">House concerts, made easy</p>
            <h1>Your living room is the best venue in town.</h1>
            <p class="mk-lead">
                GigHaus gives you a page for the show, a guest list you control and check-in at the door.
                You bring the room. The artist brings the music. It's free.
            </p>
            <div class="mk-cta-row">
                <a class="mk-btn" href="signup">Host a show</a>
                <a class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost" href="hosts">See how hosting works</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mk-hero__mascot">
            <Mascot Size="480" Class="mk-hero__image" />
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="mk-band" aria-label="GigHaus is free for hosts, artists and guests">
    <span>Free for hosts</span><span aria-hidden="true">★</span>
    <span>Free for artists</span><span aria-hidden="true">★</span>
    <span>Free to reserve</span>
</div>

<section class="mk-section">
    <div class="mk-wrap">
        <h2>We handle everything but the music.</h2>
        <p class="mk-lead mk-measure">A great house concert is mostly a great evening. The admin shouldn't get in the way of it.</p>
        <div class="mk-cards">
            <article class="mk-card">
                <h3>A page for every show</h3>
                <p>Add the artist, date and guest limit. You get a link to share with friends, neighbors and the artist's fans.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mk-card mk-card--gold">
                <h3>Your address stays private</h3>
                <p>The show page only names your city. Guests get the street address by email once you confirm them.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mk-card">
                <h3>You choose who comes in</h3>
                <p>Guests ask for a spot and you confirm them. The guest limit you set is enforced for you, so the room never overfills.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mk-card mk-card--red">
                <h3>Easy at the door</h3>
                <p>Pull up your guest list on your phone and check people in as they arrive, then go enjoy the show.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mk-section mk-section--navy">
    <div class="mk-wrap mk-setlist">
        <div>
            <p class="mk-kicker mk-kicker--gold">Tonight's set list</p>
            <h2>From spare room to full room in five steps.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="mk-steps">
            <li><strong>Tell us about your space.</strong> Your room, your city, how many people fit.</li>
            <li><strong>We say hello.</strong> GigHaus staff review every new venue before it goes live.</li>
            <li><strong>Add your show.</strong> Pick the artist, the date and a suggested donation.</li>
            <li><strong>Share your link.</strong> Guests reserve a spot and you confirm them.</li>
            <li><strong>Open the door.</strong> Check people in, dim the lights and listen.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mk-section">
    <div class="mk-wrap mk-free">
        <div class="mk-ticket">
            <p class="mk-ticket__stub">Admit all</p>
            <div>
                <h2>Free. Really.</h2>
                <p>
                    GigHaus doesn't charge hosts, artists or guests, and it takes no cut of what guests give.
                    Guests contribute at the door, and that money supports the artist.
                </p>
                <p class="mk-small">Contributions aren't charitable donations and aren't tax-deductible.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mk-section mk-section--gold">
    <div class="mk-wrap mk-closer">
        <Mascot Size="256" />
        <div>
            <h2>Got a room? Let's fill it.</h2>
            <p class="mk-lead">Sign up in a few minutes, or tell us about your space and we'll talk it through with you first.</p>
            <div class="mk-cta-row">
                <a class="mk-btn mk-btn--navy" href="signup">Host a show</a>
                <a class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost" href="contact">Talk to us first</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
